@api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7140
@api_HostAddressHttp = http://localhost:5181

GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/CmhcUpload/history
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/CmhcUpload/qr-slides/preview?fileName=Baytree%20Condo%20Portfolio.pdf
